<title>USA: Intellicall Nomura debt maturity extended.</title>
<headline>Intellicall Nomura debt maturity extended.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intellicall Inc said on Monday it received another extension on the maturity date of debt owed Nomura Holding America, to November 11.</p>
<p>The network and customer premise equipment manufacturer said it agreed to terms on a financing package and was in the process of preparing loan documentation to refinance the Nomura obligations. It said it hoped to complete refinancing by the end of October.</p>
<p>Intellicall was not immediately available for further comment.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
